				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1886222#post-2659811</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1886222/the-aftermath:but-here-s-what-really-happened#post-2659811</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 23 Sep 2016 20:15:01 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>scot7a</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>316905</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Oh, yes, the story's title refers to the title card that introduced the last of the three different endings to the movie &quot;<em>Clue</em>&quot;. But that's for the home media versions of the movie. An old fart like myself remembers seeing the movie in theaters, when I was a kid, and there, you only got to see ONE of three possible endings. If you wanted to see the other 2, you'd have to try your luck at a different theater!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
