						 <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;opinion&nbsp;post</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;click&nbsp;HERE&nbsp;to&nbsp;close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Even that works, because D-Class are <em>necessary</em>. Though I can still clearly see its Kondraki and Clef, because &quot;Konnie&quot; was what Clef called Kondraki in several older Tales - which this obviously takes cues from. Duke Till Dawn is the big one here (which should be required reading, in my silly and not completely serious opinion).</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
